      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here's a draft of the methodology section, carefully crafted to strike a balance between clarity and technical precision:\n\n\"We will utilize the AAV9 viral vector for targeted gene editing, delivering the Cas9 nuclease and its accompanying guide RNA to selectively cleave the HBB gene. This approach will enable precise modifications to the β-globin gene, thereby mimicking the correction of heterozygous mutations. The efficiency of gene editing will be assessed by analyzing DNA sequencing data and measuring protein levels in cells using standardized assays. These assays will provide a comprehensive evaluation of the Cas9-mediated modification in our sample material.\"",
      "source": "target",
